{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t大埔宏福苑火災獨立委員會的報告今天公開內容。行政長官李家超率領官員回應報告，他與相關司局長就火災發生並導致168人死亡，向市民鞠躬道歉。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n李家超表示，房屋局局長應該承擔政治責任，昨日已經接納何永賢請辭，今日起停止何永賢的局長職務，強調作出決定時已綜合考慮多個因素。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:01:37.851866+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:42:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T21:18:34.480410+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:58:41.301740+00:00","content_hash":"da7ac338f5634160f418fa39e5851ed8849cb14d35f5935f43eec187ed4eed59","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}